    <string name="setup_step_developer">Turn on Android Auto developer mode.\n\nOpen Android Auto settings. On Android 10 and later: phone Settings → Apps → Android Auto → Additional settings in the app.\n\nScroll to About and tap the version about 10 times. Confirm Allow development settings.</string>
    <string name="setup_step_sources">Allow this app in Android Auto.\n\nIn Android Auto, open the menu → Developer settings → turn on Unknown sources.\n\nRestart Android Auto if this app does not appear. It is listed with the media apps.</string>
    <string name="setup_step_tasker">Let this app run Tasker tasks.\n\nIn Tasker: Prefs → Misc → Allow External Access.\n\nAllow the permission prompt in this app. If Android does not show one, tap Fix Tasker permission.</string>
    <string name="setup_step_car">Use it in the car.\n\nOpen this app under media apps and tap a button. The action runs on the phone.\n\nA brief Loading / Failed to load screen is normal.</string>
