    <string name="tasker_permission_help">If Android does not show a prompt, grant it from a computer with adb:\n\nadb shell pm grant %1$s net.dinglisch.android.tasker.PERMISSION_RUN_TASKS\n\nOr uninstall AA Action Buttons completely, then install the APK again (not update/-r).</string>
